  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards Scholarships - 2018 intake</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards Scholarships are international scholarships funded by the Australian Government offering the next generation of global leaders an opportunity to undertake study, research and professional development. The Awards strive to develop leadership potential and stimulate lasting change by empowering a global network of talented individuals through high-quality education experiences in Australia and overseas. Recipients return home with new ideas and knowledge, and the ability to make a significant contribution to their home countries as leaders in their field. Funding under this initiative supports the global delivery for the 2018 intake over 9 years, starting 2017-18.</narrative>
  </description>
